{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\nロマンス・プライバシーのフリコピしてる中田です(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲もダンスも衣装もああいうのが好き(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあさあ、こんばんわさび！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わさびかけてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はレッスンオワタ＼^^／←違"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、前の学校で一緒だった友達に電車で会って\n一緒に帰ってるよ(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年みたま一緒に行ったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に会ったけど\n相変わらず\nメールを打つのが光の速さでした(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"the　Ｊ Ｋ　　　　きらきらきら*。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\nしかし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年でJKも終わりか〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「男子大学生」の略でもあるんだね(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこの時の服個別で着てたよね？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n着てないよ、ってか持ってないよ＞＜\nどの服のことだろ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな野菜ジュースが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nこれいちが好き！\n前にも書いたけど\n乃木坂入る前の話だけど\nAKB48さんの待ち受け集めるために\nよく飲んでたらはまった(*^^*)\n今はほぼ毎日飲んでるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国料理で何が好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nトッポギとビビンバが好き＼^^／\n行ったときは食べなかったけど＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国語話す機会あった？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n無かった(￣∇￣)\nけっこう日本語通じるんだよね！\nアニョハセヨとかカムサハムニダとかは\n使いたくて使ったけど(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いもの食べれる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n並みくらいなら食べれるよ(*・ω・)ノ\nでも、\nななみんとかみたいなんじゃないから\n辛すぎるのは無理＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏だし\n浴衣の写メこれから\nどんどん載せよ(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3404123/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪のび太くん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}